                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Shaw</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-11-23T21:00:00-05:00">November 23, 1931—9
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>590. Your 785, November 23, 5 p.m. Do not make formal protest.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
